      "content": "wow that's much more energetic lol. \n\nbut wait, looking at that draft, i noticed you didn't even mention the business owners' concerns in this one. they're actually pretty upset about the costs and how it might hurt small shops. do you think we should still include their side, or is it better to just stick to the benefits so we don't confuse people about why we're doing this?",
